ces or  things or the nouns and see if you can  identify any verbs so the pretty pig and  we're gonna cover what the is but the by  itself is not a person place or thing I  used to to kind of get a little ahead  it's called an article and we'll talk  more about that in the future pretty by  itself is not a person place or thing  and it's also not an action so let's  ignore that for now we'll get back to  that but Pig that is a person place or  thing  so pig is a noun pig is a noun and then  took not a person place or thing a not a  person place or thing bath well a bath  is a bath is a thing so that is also now  so those are the nouns right over there  so pig pig and bath now what's our verb  there's one verb in this sentence and  it's what the pig did the action the pig  did the pig took took something it took  a bath so that's our action right over  there that's our verb took is our is our  verb I think we're getting the hang of  this let's keep going the funny bird ran  quickly once again pause the video see  if you can work it out well duh by  itself is not a person place or thing  funny by itself is not a person place of  thing and neither of these are actions  bird is a person place or thing it's a  thing so bird bird is a noun bird is a  noun ran that's what the bird did that's  the action so that's going to be a verb  and quickly is neither an action nor it  is a person place or thing and we'll  study this part of speech in the future  let's look at the sentence he ate the  watch pause the video see if you can  figure out the nouns and the verbs so he  well that's a person so that's going to  be that is going to be a noun eight  that's an action that is going to be a  verb the by itself isn't the person  place or thing but watch is watch is a  thing so that's going to be or  now one more sentence dogs are silly  well dogs are clearly a thing so that's  our now now the verb might might be here  might be a little bit harder to say well  you know is what's the 